      "How payoffs, arrears, foreclosure timelines, and title work affect a Kansas City sale when mortgage payments are late.",
    href: "/resources/sell-house-behind-on-payments-kansas-city/",
    category: "Payment pressure",
  },
  {
    title: "Behind on Mortgage Payments? Compare Options",
    description:
      "A guide to lender options, HUD-approved counseling, payoff-at-closing, cash sale, payment takeover, and backup offers.",
    href: "/resources/behind-on-mortgage-options-kansas-city/",
    category: "Payment pressure",
  },
  {
    title: "Jackson County Foreclosure Options",
    description:
      "Compare lender workouts, housing counseling, payoff-at-closing, as-is cash sale, payment takeover, and backup offers in Jackson County.",
